# Title: User Added To Highly Privileged Group
# ID: 10fb649c-3600-4d37-b1e6-56ea90bb7e09
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2024-02-23
# Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.t1098
# Description: Detects addition of users to highly privileged groups via "Net" or "Add-LocalGroupMember".
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((CommandLine CONTAIN "Group Policy Creator Owners" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "Schema Admins")) AND (((CommandLine CONTAIN "localgroup " AND CommandLine CONTAIN " /add")) OR ((CommandLine CONTAIN "Add-LocalGroupMember " AND CommandLine CONTAIN " -Group "))))
